        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/ario/{size}/1866_2.png",
        "created_at": "2014-08-17T12:52:32.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>The strongest I've seen is Tempest, Greatest Legacy, and Scholar. Once Tempest got Cleansing Downpour both Tempest and Legacy could heal Scholar out of turn, and he could use his power to Bring What he Needed, keeping a steady supply of cards. They effectively weaponize healing so that the biggest problem is the Scholar being too high on health.</p>",
